  "Id": "5fb3dafe-aed4-4fff-a5b9-c144ea023d35"/*SphereMesh*/,
  "Description": "Generates a UV sphere mesh.\n\nIt can be rendered with [DrawMesh], [DrawMeshUnlit], [DrawMeshHatched] and others, or used as a source for points with [MeshVerticesToPoints] or [PointsOnMesh]. To import meshes from other programs use [LoadObj].\n\nAKA: ball, globe\n\nSee also: [IcosahedronMesh]\n\nAlso check out the [HowToDrawThings] tutorial.",
